  "purpose": "Tracks candidate / incubating / deployed strategies per market regime quadrant and asset class. This file is an INDEX, never an authority: config/portfolios.json decides what is routed and approved_incubator/<id>/meta.json decides what was certified. A disagreement is resolved against those two, never against this.",
  "quadrant_authority": {
    "module": "mdlib/regimes.py",
    "note": "The Q1..Q4 numbering is mdlib/regimes.py's and nothing else's. config/portfolios.json schema 1.0.0 numbered these incompatibly - every digit named a different environment - and 1.1.0 relabels them to agree. Never renumber these to match another document; a live daemon and a backtest disagreeing about what Q1 means is invisible downstream, because every log line still reads correctly.",
    "adx_comparator": "STRICT '>' , not '>='. mdlib/regimes.py and backtest/profiler.py have always used '>' and every cached quadrant, Stage 1 designation and Gate R verdict was drawn on it. At ADX exactly 25.00000 the bar is RANGING.",
